WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:49.050
Episode 43
Character Transformation! Amulet Diamond!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.720
I still believe. I believe in the radiance inside of me!

00:01:54.430 --> 00:01:57.600
I see. So that is your answer.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:09.410
Dia!

00:02:11.070 --> 00:02:17.350
Could it be... Is she going to Character Transform with Dia?

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.720
It's so dazzling.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:29.050
Wow!

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:31.100
It is all sparkly!

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:41.880
Dia, is that your true form?

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:43.390
Amu-chan!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.090
Right!

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:07.490
You've finally come back to me.

00:03:09.270 --> 00:03:10.970
My heart:

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.640
Unlock!

00:03:27.260 --> 00:03:29.680
Character Transformation: Amulet Diamond!

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:31.930
Amulet Diamond!

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.730
Amu-chan, this is your own radiance.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.200
My radiance?

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:44.350
The tiny sparkle that everyone has hidden inside themselves.

00:03:44.350 --> 00:03:48.100
Because you believed in it, the radiance was called forth.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.990
You did it, Amu-chan!

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:57.290
Welcome back, Dia!

00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:59.470
Welcome home, really!

00:03:59.470 --> 00:04:01.330
That's amazing, Amu-chi!

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.910
You sure did it.

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:06.370
Utau.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.730
What's the matter Utau?

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:10.810
I can't stand up.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:15.290
It takes a lot of energy to Character Transform with someone else's Guardian Character.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.890
Utau-chan transformed with Dia, and now...

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.640
She no longer has the power to fight.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:27.340
I aimed to be bigger than everyone.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:30.100
To not lose to anyone.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:32.170
To work through the pain.

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:39.770
So why did... Why did everyone leave me?

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.850
Utau.

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.600
Utau-chan.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.380
What's the matter? If we don't take off soon...

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.100
Enough, Utau!

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:57.580
I've lost to Amu.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.180
No!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:02.610
You haven't lost anything, Utau.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:06.220
Because we weren't competing in the first place.

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.960
And you still have your songs!

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.570
That's right!

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.850
You have your wonderful songs.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.720
I no longer remember...

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.220
How can I sing them?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.510
That voice...

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:28.150
I-It can't be...

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.390
It's Utau-chan!

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:30.390
Ami!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.450
Yay, yay!

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.930
Did you follow me here?

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:46.060
Wowy! It's the weal Utau-chan!

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:51.560
Uh, sorry about this, I know it's not a good time.

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:53.730
Oh, Sis!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:57.980
Um, this is my little sister; she's a big fan of yours.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:00.470
She's always mimicking you in front of the TV.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:01.930
Ta-da!

00:06:02.440 --> 00:06:04.240
And out comes her "My Mic."

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.170
She carries it with her everywhere.

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:10.140
And now, I will perform Hoshina Utau's "Butterfly's Labyrinth!" { Was translated as "Butterfly that Lost its Way," change back if she messed up the name for real}

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.890
Da shadow of desire covering da writhing city {yokubou...}

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:17.690
prowls around in an angel's guise. {tenshi...}

00:06:15.050 --> 00:06:17.690
The atmosphere has completely changed all of a sudden, hasn't it?

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:21.190
Cwadling, as if pwecious, da shards {taisetsu...}

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.930
Yeah, definitely.

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:20.560
She's kind of off-key.

00:06:21.030 --> 00:06:22.790
Somehow we're being completely...

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:25.030
of dweams with no place left to go. {ikiba...}

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:25.030
Swept along by Ami-chan.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.850
As sleep is about to take you...

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.640
That's our little shrimp for you.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.920
Hey, Utau-chan, sing!

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.260
Sing us a song!

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:39.410
Whenever you'd come on, Ami would be glued to the TV, Utau.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:42.930
She always enjoys your songs.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:48.670
I used to be just like that.

00:06:49.240 --> 00:06:53.820
Fun songs, painful songs, love songs...

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:57.100
Facing the dazzling lights... I loved it all.

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:05.220
I was entranced; my cheeks would turn red, and my eyes would sparkle.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:09.600
The same eyes this child has.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.130
Utau.

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:18.100
Hey, Utau-chan, sing!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.450
Right now, I just...

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:23.640
It's okay!

00:07:24.410 --> 00:07:27.380
You wanted to make someone happy with your song,

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:30.100
and it's that feeling that gave birth to me.

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:33.800
Since I'm still here... Since I haven't disappeared,

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:37.530
that means there's still that kind song somewhere inside of you, Utau-chan.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.650
The song only you, who can't be tied down by anyone, can sing.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:43.310
That's the only weapon you need, Utau.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.800
Utau.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:54.770
Utau-chan.

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:10.600
Sing. Just like you used to.

00:08:28.970 --> 00:08:37.890
As the bud of my dream opens up to the brilliant sky, {yume no...}

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:45.520
it spreads a gentle fragrance through my heart.  {mune ippai}

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:55.020
I can hear the rhythm of love.  {kikeru...}

00:08:55.020 --> 00:09:04.020
You've come to greet me with the changing seasons. {kisetsu...}

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:13.930
If I whisper that I love you, {daisuki da yo...}

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:22.770
I wonder if the whole world will hear? {sekai chuu...}

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:30.810
Embarrassed, I look down. {hazukashikute...}

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:30.810
Even without dazzling lights or a grand stage, there's still such a gentle song...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:42.700
Take my hand so we can run. {watashi no te...}

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:36.220
There's still such a wonderful song inside of Utau.

00:09:37.570 --> 00:09:42.450
A song that pierces everyone's hearts with its kindness.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:55.770
Sister!

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:58.970
Fine, then! I'll go to L.A. by myself!

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:03.780
If we press all of those X Eggs, we can complete the master CD.

00:10:03.780 --> 00:10:06.720
And we'll debut Black Diamond to the world!

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:11.020
At this rate, the X Eggs' song will be spread across the globe!

00:10:11.020 --> 00:10:11.970
What should we do?

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.110
I'll grab victory with my own hands!

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:18.430
That's right, I'll get the Embryo!

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:31.640
What, what? What's going on?

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.730
This feeling...

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:34.640
Yeah!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.680
X Characters?

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:16.100
Everyone, engage!

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.370
Understood.

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.490
Roger!

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.270
You can count on me.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:22.560
Holy Crown Special!

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.890
Juggling Party!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.890
Tightrope Dancer.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.350
Thank you, Mashiro-san.

00:12:03.350 --> 00:12:04.470
Don't mention it.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.390
I used the backs of my swords, worry not.

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:26.950
You go, Chairman! So cool!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.770
Okay, I'm gonna do it, too!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:35.390
Time for... Go Go Little Duckies!

00:12:57.410 --> 00:12:59.190
What?

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.970
That's not playing fair!

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:10.810
Sis!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:27.930
Tadase-kun, Chairman!

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:38.890
Thunder Blade!

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.930
Now, King!

00:13:44.180 --> 00:13:47.020
White Decoration!

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:05.130
Wowy! The King and Mister Samurai-oniichan are both really cool!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.180
Mister Samurai?

00:14:15.350 --> 00:14:19.430
Hey, stop it, this isn't cute! Get away!

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:20.430
Sister!

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:22.920
Sanjo-san!

00:14:23.390 --> 00:14:24.310
El.

00:14:25.290 --> 00:14:26.430
Lend me your power.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:29.810
Of course!

00:14:30.910 --> 00:14:32.370
My heart:

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.350
Unlock!

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:52.060
Character Transformation: Seraphic Charm!

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:55.300
Wow, it's an angel!

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.640
You did it, Utau, El!

00:14:57.910 --> 00:14:59.640
It is so wonderful!

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:01.100
Wow!

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.140
Utau.

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.020
Utau!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:08.900
There's no time.

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:10.520
Let's work together.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.390
Okay!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.750
El!

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:30.970
Yes!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:36.180
Angel Cradle!

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:57.020
All the X Eggs are falling asleep.

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:07.470
It's like a lullaby.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.020
The X's are disappearing.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.170
I never knew you had such power, El.

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.390
It's not my power.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:26.020
This is the song that's been sleeping inside of you.

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:30.880
You're able to sing these gentle songs, too, Utau-chan.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.850
Sanjo-san!

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:38.020
Someone save me!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:45.810
Sanjo-san!

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.180
Amu-chan!

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:55.390
Amu-chan, set it free! Free your radiance!

00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:56.350
Right!

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.170
Starlight

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:13.390
Navigation!

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.020
Wow!

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.350
It's so pretty.

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:31.390
It's a star shower!

00:17:31.890 --> 00:17:35.140
So this is the power of Amu-chan's radiance!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.100
Thank goodness.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.010
Why did you save me?

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.180
Don't you hate me?

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.260
Haven't we been together since I debuted?

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.020
It'd make things difficult if you left me right now.

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.270
Utau!

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:23.710
Why'd you have to go and say something like that?

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:26.810
She has her soft side, too.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:30.060
Utau.

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.270
Ikuto?

00:18:33.190 --> 00:18:39.440
Now you can sing your own song, not just one for my sake.

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:46.780
It's the Hearts' Eggs!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.580
They look like they're having fun!

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:53.020
It's like they're thanking Amu-chan and Utau-chan.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:56.180
There's that egg again.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:57.540
The Embryo!

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:58.680
The Embryo?

00:19:06.440 --> 00:19:09.890
So that's the Embryo?

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.680
Amu-chan.

00:19:16.390 --> 00:19:17.720
Dia.

00:19:18.400 --> 00:19:23.260
Amu-chan, this radiance is inside you.

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.640
Don't forget that, okay?

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.730
You're really going? Why?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.270
But we finally met.

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:33.360
Remember, Amu-chan.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:37.640
No matter how much it is attacked by the darkness, that radiance will never die out.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:43.530
The light inside of you... That small glittering fragment...

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:46.060
That name is...

00:20:07.900 --> 00:20:10.020
Let's go, Yoru.

00:20:23.340 --> 00:20:26.090
A Few Days Later

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:26.600
Hey, did you hear 'bout Hoshina Utau?

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:30.350
Yeah, I know! They say she suddenly quit Easter Music!

00:20:30.350 --> 00:20:32.890
Would she really quit at the height of her popularity?

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:36.600
No way, I hadn't heard! Why would she?

00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.600
Man, you should've stuck with Easter.

00:20:40.980 --> 00:20:45.320
You just threw away your big place as an idol! What a waste.

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:49.150
But I guess that's just the way you are, Utau-chan!

00:20:50.590 --> 00:20:53.890
So what should we accomplish today?

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.140
Well, look at this.

00:20:56.730 --> 00:21:00.770
A day off, with nothing to do? Haven't had one of these in a while.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.520
Sanjo-san.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:09.640
What a coincidence! Just when I was thinking of trying to contact you, and tell you I'd rented a new office.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.960
A new office?

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.030
You mean, you also...

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.860
Yup. I'm through with big companies like Easter.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:20.640
From now on, I plan on doing things myself.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:25.460
But I guess the first thing I have to do is find an exclusive artist to sign.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.940
Of course, it can't be just anyone, now can it?

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:31.270
Naturally.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:33.900
So this means...

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.770
Things are gettin' interesting again, yeah!

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:41.110
All right! We're going right back to the top!

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:42.900
We've got nothing to lose!

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.540
Our goal is superstardom!

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:46.330
Female President!

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:55.210
So Dia went back into her egg, huh?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:58.200
We didn't even get to see her face.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:22:01.240
I wanted to meet her, too.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.720
But you know...

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:06.810
I think we'll meet her again pretty soon.

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:09.810
The radiance inside of me...

00:22:10.480 --> 00:22:14.670
I'm sure that's a trace of the future.

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:53.400
Amu-chan's summer vacation is finally upon us!

00:23:53.400 --> 00:23:56.080
The Guardians have now all Character Transformed.

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:58.990
And El, Il, and Dia also Character Transformed.

00:23:58.990 --> 00:24:01.120
Pool, homework, moving!

00:24:01.120 --> 00:24:03.200
Watching fireworks wearing a yukata, goldfish scooping!

